OL,3,GNEWSA'Missing man' left #12k worth of
OL,4,Aketamine in hotel's storage room
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who had been reported missing
OL,7,Fchecked in a bag containing #12,500 of
OL,8,Fdrugs into the hotel where he was
OL,9,Fstaying.
OL,11,FMichael Redmond, 41, handed over the
OL,12,Fholdall full of ketamine at Glasgow
OL,13,Fcity centre's Holiday Inn Express on 28
OL,14,FApril 2025.
OL,16,FGlasgow Sheriff Court heard how Redmond
OL,17,Fwas reported as a missing person to
OL,18,Fpolice the previous day.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
